WEBVTT

00:00:06.647 --> 00:00:12.207
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> Before dinner, Gordon had a drink with Jeremy in the library.

00:00:18.683 --> 00:00:22.355
<v><b>Gordon:</b></v> Cheers, Jeremy. Happy Birthday.

00:00:23.033 --> 00:00:24.404
<v><b>Jeremy:</b></v> Ah, thanks, Gordon.

00:00:25.743 --> 00:00:29.604
<v><b>Gordon:</b></v> Listen, Jeremy, I want to talk to you about Barbara.

00:00:30.184 --> 00:00:30.957
<v><b>Jeremy:</b></v> Barbara?

00:00:31.783 --> 00:00:32.876
What’s the problem?

00:00:33.965 --> 00:00:35.476
<v><b>Gordon:</b></v> It’s not exactly a problem.

00:00:37.297 --> 00:00:40.021
I’m in love with her, and I want to marry her.

00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:48.087
<v><b>Jeremy:</b></v> Marry Barbara? Marry my daughter!

00:00:50.355 --> 00:00:56.059
Are you crazy? Never! You don’t love Barbara.

00:00:56.083 --> 00:00:57.473
You only want her money!

00:00:57.487 --> 00:00:58.785
<v><b>Gordon:</b></v> That’s not true, Jeremy.

00:00:58.786 --> 00:00:59.726
I love her.

00:01:00.305 --> 00:01:01.212
<v><b>Jeremy:</b></v> Listen to me.

00:01:02.172 --> 00:01:07.260
If you marry Barbara, when I die all my money goes to Claudia.

00:01:08.548 --> 00:01:11.572
<v><b>Gordon:</b></v> To Claudia? To your secretary?

00:01:11.945 --> 00:01:12.792
<v><b>Jeremy:</b></v> Yes.

00:01:13.965 --> 00:01:16.819
<v><b>Gordon:</b></v> Is that your last word, Jeremy?

00:01:17.098 --> 00:01:18.325
<v><b>Jeremy:</b></v> Yes, it is.

00:01:18.918 --> 00:01:20.425
<v><b>Cook:</b></v> Dinner everybody!

00:01:32.439 --> 00:01:35.818
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> At midnight Gordon was in the living room.

00:01:40.594 --> 00:01:45.484
He finished his whisky and went upstairs.

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:14.647
<v><b>Jeremy:</b></v> Who is it?

00:02:15.208 --> 00:02:16.121
Gordon?

00:02:16.575 --> 00:02:21.740
What are you…